OL,3,GNEWSAGranddad died after getting stuck
OL,4,Ain barbed wire on daily mountain walk
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man died days after getting trapped
OL,7,Fin barbed wire while on a mountain
OL,8,Fwalk, an inquest heard.
OL,10,FMalcolm Kitts, 92, had celebrated his
OL,11,Fbirthday with a family party just days
OL,12,Fbefore setting off from his home in
OL,13,FCwmdare, Rhondda Cynon Taf, in
OL,14,FSeptember on one of his daily walks.
OL,16,FBut Kitts, who was described as a
OL,17,F"physically active" granddad who had
OL,18,Fbeen diagnosed with dementia, did not
OL,19,Freturn.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
