OL,3,GNEWSAGranddad died after getting stuck
OL,4,Ain barbed wire on daily mountain walk
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was found on Maerdy mountain the
OL,7,Ffollowing day where he had likely
OL,8,Ffallen, with his leg tangled in a
OL,9,Fbarbed wire fence.
